  "_comment": "Field descriptions modelled on real job-application forms (Plan §7.6). Each fixture names the platform, the field's signals as the autofill service would see them, and what Tote should do. Labels in 'expect' refer to the test vault in FixtureTest. Shared format, reusable by a future TypeScript port.",
